Queen	interacts with	No! NO! AHHH
Queen	interacts with	No! NO! AHHH
Queens	interacts with	We have a gift for you.
Ordis	interacts with	Operator, Ordis has been thinking. Now that you are here in the flesh, we should make the Orbiter more comfortable. Ordis has identified an old storage space you could use. Stand by while I --TORCH THIS JUNK-- dispose of my old belongings. Out with the old and in with the new, right, Operator? Construct this Domestic Habitation Segment to extend life support to your new room.
Ordis	interacts with	What's this? An Old War beacon? How exciting, Operator. You will want to investigate this... Oh. I'm sorry... did I interrupt?
Ordis	interacts with	Impressive! Just think of the possibilities! You can help me clean up that Infested door!
Ordis	interacts with	You rescued your Warframe! What a relief. But... Ordis wonders, are you still able to walk the ship as... yourself?
Ordis	interacts with	Thank the stars you're safe Operator! I forbid you to leave the Orbiter like that again, it's just too much for an old Cephalon like me.
Ordis	interacts with	Operator, where are you going? Don't leave meeeeee...
Ordis	interacts with	Haven't you been listening? The Transference system is fried!
Ordis	interacts with	Impossible! Just as you thought, the base has moved again. We don't know where it is. There's no way back.
Ordis	interacts with	Have you lost your mind?
Ordis	interacts with	Operator, you'll breach the hull! Please restrain yourself.
Ordis	interacts with	Oh. There you are! Impressive. Very useful. Ordis is a little afraid right now.
Ordis	interacts with	Operator, my sensors have gone dark. Where are you?
Ordis	interacts with	Amazing. How are you doing this? It is slightly terrifying if I'm honest.
Ordis	interacts with	Hmm... this is odd. The circuits are dead but I'm detecting Transference energy... coming from... coming from you?!
Ordis	interacts with	Understood. The Operator does not like music.
Ordis	interacts with	Music? ...Operator you are not making sense! The Transference surge must have affected you as well. Try to rest while I begin repairs.
Ordis	interacts with	Operator? Is that... is that 'you'? Your brain activity flat-lined for a moment there... Can you speak? By stars, the Operator's mind is destroyed?!!
Ordis	interacts with	CUT THE LINK! Transference overload in 5...4...3...2...1
Ordis	interacts with	CUT THE LINK!
Ordis	interacts with	Operator! Cut the link... cut the link!
Ordis	interacts with	--Exterminate! Exterminate the non-Operator.--
Ordis	interacts with	--You are not the Operator. You will be purged.--
Ordis	interacts with	Ex-Operator, if you get to the navigation console, I may be able to detach the landing craft before I... before I kill you.
Ordis	interacts with	Former Operator, Ordis cannot keep missing like this! Get out of here before --I Purge you.--
Ordis	interacts with	Non-operator, I'm sorry to inconvenience you, but I'm going to decompress the ship now.
Ordis	interacts with	--You no longer possess Transference. You no longer command the Warframes. You no longer are the Operator. You must be purged from this vessel.--
Ordis	interacts with	What? Gone? Are you sure? How will you command the Warframes if your --Conditions satisfied. Engaging Purge Precept.--
Ordis	interacts with	I've been trying. You may need to do your uh... Tenno thing again. Re-energize it, you know, with your... Void stuff!
Ordis	interacts with	Isn't it great? I can lead you through some breathing exercises...
Ordis	interacts with	Operator?! By stars! Don't do that to me. I am sorry I do not know what happened. Please, command me to self-destruct. Let me start it for you... commencing self-destruct in 5--4--3--2--
Ordis	interacts with	Great job, Ordis. Ship Cephalon? More like Ship Fail-bot. When the Operator needed you most you --
Ordis	interacts with	CUT THE LINK! Transference overload in 5... 4... 3...
Ordis	interacts with	Operator! Cut the link!
Ordis	interacts with	A Transference surge, Operator! You're losing your Warframe connection!
Ordis	interacts with	Operator, if you must enter the Queens' Fortress, you'll need to hurry, it could disappear at any moment.
Ordis	interacts with	Ordis no longer detects any security.
Ordis	interacts with	Yes. Might I say that was smooth, Operator.
Ordis	interacts with	You're clear.
Ordis	interacts with	(sigh of relief) This is the last scanner.
Ordis	interacts with	Watch out, to the ship's left, another scanner.
Ordis	interacts with	Another scanner, to the right of the ship.
Ordis	interacts with	They're going to scan the top of the transport, get below it.
Ordis	interacts with	Operator, watch that transport ahead. The scanner is only able to scan one side at a time. You can use that to your advantage.
Ordis	interacts with	Well, outside this corridor lie burst scanners, severe radiation, proximity mines, --GRINEER DEATH BEAMS-- so yes, Ordis recommends staying within the shipping corridor.
Teshin	interacts with	The world weighs more heavily on you now. Try not to lose yourself, Tenno.
Teshin	interacts with	I believe them both. But for you, Tenno, perhaps this Kuva is just a symbol. That what you choose to do will define you more than anything.
Teshin	interacts with	Others believe it to be a poison, a corrupting oil that brings madness and evil.
Teshin	interacts with	Hmm... Some believe the Kuva within is the blood of the Orokin Ancestors. An elixir of power... of immortality.
Teshin	interacts with	You don't know what to do with it.
Teshin	interacts with	The Worm has rallied the troops. Get to your ship. I'll divert them. Go!
Teshin	interacts with	Shall I, Tenno?
Teshin	interacts with	A chance to kill you... and now I finally have it.
Teshin	interacts with	Without her Sceptre[sic], she is powerless. Break her shields and use your dash to steal it.
Teshin	interacts with	I... Cannot go... On...
Teshin	interacts with	I am beaten.
Teshin	interacts with	You are a child no longer.
Teshin	interacts with	You must not stop, defeat me.
Teshin	interacts with	Yes! From the moment I began training you, I have anticipated this moment.
Teshin	interacts with	I can show you no mercy, show me none in return.
Teshin	interacts with	That child I met on the mountain will surely die here.
Teshin	interacts with	No, I cannot.
Teshin	interacts with	The red braids shield her. Destroy them!
Teshin	interacts with	They're vulnerable. Attack.
Teshin	interacts with	Let the Guardians feel your pulse from the Void.
Teshin	interacts with	Tenno, remember the Golden Maw and how you brought it to heel.
Teshin	interacts with	They are protected by the Kuva in their weapons. Find a way to disarm them.
Teshin	interacts with	Their weapons contain Kuva, it protects them from your Warframe but not from your Tenno powers.
Teshin	interacts with	It's time to show the Queens what they have awoken within you.
Teshin	interacts with	Remember the mountain. Remember your new strength.
Teshin	interacts with	Tenno, this is one fight your Warframe cannot win.
Teshin	interacts with	The Guardians protect the braids, the braids protect the Queen.
Teshin	interacts with	Tenno, no! After everything you've endured to escape, why did you come back?
Teshin	interacts with	Forgive me, my Queens.
Teshin	interacts with	No. The Queen doesn't want to kill you. She wants to become you. To burrow through your mind corrupting it with despair until only she remains.
Teshin	interacts with	A Yuvan theater, long abandoned. In ages past, I would have stood guard as the young and exotic were paraded through the mountain pass and marched by the viewing pane. They'd barter here, the Orokin. Withering and coughing- as they prepared for their Continuity.
Teshin	interacts with	To obey their command. To never defy the Kuva, the Scepter, the symbols of their dominion. No Dax can ever raise steel against an Orokin. Only you can do that.
Teshin	interacts with	Know this Tenno, that I am a Dax. A soldier of a lost era, the last of my kind. By Orokin hands we Dax were given great power, great strength... but an even greater weakness.
Teshin	interacts with	Your repressed power has returned, fused with your Tenno abilities, amplifying them. You've outgrown the cradle. Now your Transference is innate. Control these Orokin beasts and escape this prison.
Teshin	interacts with	The Queen is nearly through. She knows what you did, giving her resolve. Now, you must master the fold. Walk upon its edge, concealing your movement within the shadows you create.
Teshin	interacts with	You exist on the fold between two worlds. The world we know, of blood and steel, and the world that watches and dreams, the Void. Charge across the fold as you once did.
Teshin	interacts with	Destroy this barrier and go deeper into your past.
Teshin	interacts with	Your past has weathered Margulis' manipulation. It lurks here, your only hope of surviving the Queens.
Teshin	interacts with	The Queen burrows into your mind just as the creature worms beneath your feet. With each step, you will discover what Margulis took from you. With each step, pain awaits you.
Teshin	interacts with	Beware the ravenous Golden Maw!
Teshin	interacts with	The Ayatan Sculptures are perpetually in motion, monuments of Orokin Continuity... immortality. But this one is halted and aging, needing you, as the Queens do. Will you give in to them? Or will you face the coil?
Teshin	interacts with	Margulis lied to you, a lie of omission. She did not cure the Zariman children - she erased them. My only hope is that truth still lingers inside you, buried within your mind. The power and the misery... of the Void.
Teshin	interacts with	I warned you. Now you're trapped inside this place with the Queens burrowing in. Now I am forced to undo what Margulis did, to open the gates... and make you suffer.
Teshin	interacts with	As I thought. The hard way, then.
Teshin	interacts with	Yes, do it.
Teshin	interacts with	They gave up.
Teshin	interacts with	The child? For what purpose?
Teshin	interacts with	I have come, as you commanded, my Queens.
Teshin	interacts with	You shouldn't have come here. You've ruined us both.
Teshin	interacts with	Follow me again, Tenno, and you will answer to my sword.
Teshin	interacts with	I am warning you. You think you're safe behind this metal, but you're not. Not in the ways that matter here. Behind this, you're still just a child --
Teshin	interacts with	The Queens.
Teshin	interacts with	Leave now. This doesn't concern you, child.
Operator	interacts with	I won't.
Operator	interacts with	What do you believe?
Operator	interacts with	Tell me.
Operator	interacts with	Don't. Don't do that. Don't make excuses for me.
Operator	interacts with	That's what you have to say? That I'm 'changed'?
Operator	interacts with	But isn't it better I know the truth? Wouldn't you want to know? Teshin said--
Operator	interacts with	Understood.
Operator	interacts with	We have neutralized the Queens. Teshin... Teshin helped me. I'm heading to extraction now.
Operator	interacts with	Kill her.
Operator	interacts with	No. I will do it.
Operator	interacts with	No. Let her rot. That will be her sentence.
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	That child is gone.
Operator	interacts with	I came back for you.
Operator	interacts with	I don't need it anymore.
Operator	interacts with	My Warframe. It's still there.
Operator	interacts with	No. But I've lost my Warframe... and Teshin... what if the Queens know that he helped me escape? I have to go back.
Operator	interacts with	I... I'm fine. Just... just don't play any music. I need to think.
Operator	interacts with	(screams)
Operator	interacts with	I embraced it.
Operator	interacts with	I controlled it.
Operator	interacts with	I hated it.
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	She doesn't want me dead.
Operator	interacts with	Control them? Like a Warframe?
Operator	interacts with	They were nothing but animals by then. So I hunted.
Operator	interacts with	They had lost their minds. I didn't blame them. We build[sic] a makeshift prison.
Operator	interacts with	I held out hope we'd be rescued. So I avoided the bloodshed.
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	I can hear them...
Operator	interacts with	Shadows I create. Another Teshin metaphor, right?
Operator	interacts with	They tore her apart.
Operator	interacts with	This is my family now.
Operator	interacts with	I smell... smoke.
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	Incredible. And I was kicking myself for not bringing a rope.
Operator	interacts with	The whole ship went insane.
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	Something's out there, kiddo... watching us.
Operator	interacts with	The air was acrid and still.
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	Sounds great, Teshin.
Operator	interacts with	I can't even remember her face.
Operator	interacts with	Why does it have to be ravenous?
Operator	interacts with	(struggles to remove bone that stabbed into their leg)
Operator	interacts with	(gasps)
Operator	interacts with	She's lying.
Operator	interacts with	I remember...
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	So the great Teshin is just a dog... fetching the Queen's stick wherever she throws it.
Operator	interacts with	You... you betrayed me, you Infested piece of--
Operator	interacts with	Ugh... What happened to you?
Operator	interacts with	Purge? Purge what?! Ordis?! What the hell?!
Operator	interacts with	I-I can't. It's... gone.
Operator	interacts with	Just... just turn it off! Get the Transference power back on, okay? I lost my Warframe.
Operator	interacts with	Stop... uh... what's with the music?
Operator	interacts with	Ordis, enough.
Operator	interacts with	(grunts)
Operator	interacts with	I... I can't!
Operator	interacts with	Ordis! What is this?!
Operator	interacts with	ENOUGH!
Operator	interacts with	Teshin Dax... you're with them?
Operator	interacts with	Teshin?!
Operator	interacts with	I know this place.
Operator	interacts with	Lotus? If you can hear me, something's tampering with the Transference stream. I'm going to locate the source.
Operator	interacts with	Lotus, are you receiving me?
Operator	interacts with	Massively fortified. The Queens have to be here. I'm going to infiltrate the base.
Operator	interacts with	Fine. I'll head back to the Orbiter, but the base won't be here for long.
Operator	interacts with	If the base moves again, we'll lose this opportunity. I'm going in.
Operator	interacts with	Negative. I'm heading in for a closer look.
Operator	interacts with	Are those Fomorian engines mounted on an asteroid? No wonder we've never been able to find it. It's always moving.
Operator	interacts with	Are you seeing this?!
Operator	interacts with	I've picked up the trail again.
Operator	interacts with	Understood.
Operator	interacts with	Why hasn't he reached out to us? If he is pursuing the Queens, we can help him.
Operator	interacts with	No. Teshin's not going to tell me what I can and cannot do. I'll take out his Specters so you can track him.
Operator	interacts with	I have a feeling Teshin has. Can you track him?
Operator	interacts with	Stop saying that.
Operator	interacts with	Queens?! The Grineer Queens? Tell me what--
Operator	interacts with	What was that?
Operator	interacts with	Don't call me that. What are you doing here?
Operator	interacts with	I just saw the intruder... moving fast. I think it's Teshin.
Operator	interacts with	But we weren't born here, were we?
Operator	interacts with	On it.
Operator	interacts with	I... just... nodded off. It's nothing.
Lotus	interacts with	What you did. You didn't have a choice. Tenno, you were only just a--
Lotus	interacts with	Teshin thinks he knows better. Maybe he does? Maybe you needed to know to survive the Queens. But you are changed now.
Lotus	interacts with	A mother wants to shield her child from the evils of the world. Margulis didn't lie to you. She protected you.
Lotus	interacts with	The Queens... they cut me off... I should have been there for you. I'll signal Ordis to pick you up right away.
Lotus	interacts with	Tenno? Tenno? I've been trying to get through. Are you... alright? Your Transference stream seems different, stronger.
Lotus	interacts with	(static) There is a lot of Transference distortion in this area. I recommend we abort this mission and wait for Teshin to reach out.
Lotus	interacts with	(static) Excellent, Tenno. Now get out of there. We'll need to analyze the intel you've gathered before our next move.
Lotus	interacts with	(static) It must be the Queens' Fortress.
Lotus	interacts with	You are in the clear. Keep moving.
Lotus	interacts with	Good, but we can't take any chances, silence the remaining Grineer.
Lotus	interacts with	They're coming for you. Don't let them abort the shutdown.
Lotus	interacts with	This checkpoint is the central hub of the security matrix. Shut it down so Ordis can fly you in undetected.
Lotus	interacts with	You've been detected. They know you are here.
Lotus	interacts with	You're through. Land at the checkpoint.
Lotus	interacts with	Nicely done. They still haven't seen you.
Lotus	interacts with	You heard Ordis. Keep the transport between yourself and the beams. Do not let them touch you.
Lotus	interacts with	Something is hiding in this asteroid field but before you can investigate you need to disable the security matrix. Ordis, are you certain this is the best angle of approach?
Lotus	interacts with	Teshin's Specter points to what should be an unpopulated asteroid field, but deep scans show the presence of a security-matrix. Someone is trying to hide something, I need you to find out what. Prepare your Archwing.
Lotus	interacts with	Well done. Return to your ship, I will alert you when I've decrypted this Specter's control signature.
Lotus	interacts with	That's not Teshin, it's another one of his Specters. He's trying to shake us off the trail. Capture that Specter, we can use it to find the real Teshin.
Lotus	interacts with	Pride or shame, he does seem to have some connection to them. Stay on the trail. Finding the Queens could give us a tactical advantage against the Grineer.
Lotus	interacts with	All my scans for Teshin have converged on this location. Find him.
Lotus	interacts with	Teshin is trying to mask his location from us, but I have pinpointed a suspicious signal for you to investigate. Find him, we need answers.
Lotus	interacts with	I have a lock on his route. Exfiltrate when you're ready.
Lotus	interacts with	Not with Specters masking him. But Tenno, we don't know anything about the Queens. Maybe Teshin alone should--
Lotus	interacts with	I thought the Queens were just an invention of Grineer command. No one has ever seen them in the flesh.
Lotus	interacts with	Teshin? What is he doing here? It looks like he's heading to a Reservoir. Follow him.
Lotus	interacts with	I'm detecting an unknown signature further ahead. Find out who it is and what they're doing.
Lotus	interacts with	No. When the Zariman was found adrift, the Orokin did everything they could to erase their mistakes. Transit recordings, personnel logs... everything was wiped out. The only thing they kept was... you.
Lotus	interacts with	It was here Margulis put you into the dream, tried to heal you... tried to give you the strength to tame the Void within you. In a way, this is where you, where all Tenno, were born.
Lotus	interacts with	Good. Deploy a Warframe to Lua. My sentries have gone silent. We may have an intrusion.
Lotus	interacts with	Tenno? Are you alright? Your Somatics output seems high.
Worm Queen	interacts with	Where do you think you're going skin suit? I have plans for you, delicious plans.
Worm Queen	interacts with	Beast! Get that thing! Don't let it escape!
Worm Queen	interacts with	Sister! The dreamer's come for us!
Worm Queen	interacts with	(gasp) How rude!
Worm Queen	interacts with	(laughs) To eat it, of course!
Worm Queen	interacts with	And this is your offering? My sister needs the orphan child, not its Infested puppet.
Worm Queen	interacts with	But the dreamers have awakened. They will come for us.
Elder Queen	interacts with	(ambient noises)
Elder Queen	interacts with	(coughing)
Elder Queen	interacts with	(screeches)
Elder Queen	interacts with	What are you waiting for, Dax?
Elder Queen	interacts with	(screeches)
Elder Queen	interacts with	Show yourself you little coward.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Is this how you hunted the Zariman crew? Is this how you murdered your parents?
Elder Queen	interacts with	I see now, how you cast me out. Simple, really. There's no room for me in that wicked, swarming head of yours.
Elder Queen	interacts with	You'll pay for that.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Come out, come out, little demon.
Elder Queen	interacts with	We are Orokin! We created you! We are your Golden Lords!
Elder Queen	interacts with	You must. By your oath eternal.
Elder Queen	interacts with	By my Orokin blood, I command you, Teshin Dax, to kill this Tenno.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Long enough have I lived in this ugly Grineer bodies. I need new flesh... I deserve new flesh! Yours! Guards! Kill this Warframe and bring me my new skin!
Elder Queen	interacts with	Guards! Kill this Tenno!
Elder Queen	interacts with	Shut up you insolent Dax!
Elder Queen	interacts with	Stupid child. You don't give up, do you? But coming here in the flesh? That was a big mistake. Guards! Kill this Warframe and bring me my new skin!
Elder Queen	interacts with	We hold the Scepter! We command you. We are--
Elder Queen	interacts with	What did you do, Dax? What did you do?! How did a child reject the Continuity?
Elder Queen	interacts with	No crew aboard, only the children... only the parricidal monsters they had become. The endless Void, the gazing abyss, the bottomless ocean of horror... it coiled itself around your tender heart.
Elder Queen	interacts with	The grownups are howling at the door... drowning mad in the Void ocean but you... you are at ease swimming within the depths! You remember then how the howling stopped - they had broken through.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Fires rage on the lower decks. Blood shimmers in the fitful light. Hunting parties roam the ship. But there is singing and laughter and play... for all the children have come together. Their minds, somehow unbent. You wipe away your tears, thinking-
Elder Queen	interacts with	The biomes had been sabotaged. The food stocks dwindled. Paranoia gripped your father's mind. What was it he said - as he stared out into the starless black?
Elder Queen	interacts with	Mother takes your hand and says there's been an accident. But don't worry, angel, you're safe with me. Her eyes are distant, unfocused...
Elder Queen	interacts with	We gave you your precious gifts. And now, just as easily, we take them all away!
Elder Queen	interacts with	But you belong to me now. For you see, child, we conceived of these ugly, metal cysts.
Elder Queen	interacts with	You have some idea that you're invincible, don't you? Nestled away in that mad Cephalon's crib-
Elder Queen	interacts with	Oh, it's not their fault, worm. Mommy and Daddy weren't around long enough to teach them any manners. (laugh) We will have to.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Hush worm! Do not question your Lords, Teshin Dax. Bring me the orphan. Bring me my Yuvan.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Well done, Teshin Dax.
Elder Queen	interacts with	We're so glad you came.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Bring them to me.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Yes, they will... like the answer to a prayer.
Elder Queen	interacts with	Hush, worm. Let the beasts do their work.
